  "rewrites": {
   "2": {
    "original": "On the second windswept chunk of Cape, n\u00e4wahnit Martin (pronounced \"nawnahin\") ran on a runaway immigration program that had no chance of getting passed and also promised an attack on the Massachusetts Health Care Reform Law according to the editorial policy of the Salem News, which endorsed her on account of her identity according to the comments of the editorial column.",
